			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760620501,
					"content": "烏吉好像安靜下來了，所以…其實那些月光藤蔓才是罪魁禍首嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620502,
					"content": "但他還在痛苦，我看得出來，他的思維很混亂，沒辦法與我交流。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620503,
					"content": "是因為他體內的資訊…我感覺到了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620504,
					"content": "我和他…是同類…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620505,
					"content": "黑蛋你要幹什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620506,
					"content": "他身體裡…有烏吉恩圈終端機的資訊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620507,
					"content": "還記得嗎？那個終端機附近…也長了一樣的月光藤蔓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620508,
					"content": "你是說…是這傢伙吸收了那裡的資訊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620509,
					"content": "嗯…那些資訊裡…也許儲存著望月者計畫的內容…那一定就是我的使命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620510,
					"content": "但是這也太危險了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620511,
					"content": "派蒙，讓寧寧去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620512,
					"content": "她誕生在月亮上，是我因為擔心，擅自將她送去了離家萬里的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620513,
					"content": "#為了使命，她在{F#妳}{M#你}們的幫助下想盡辦法回到了這裡，回到了她的家鄉。她的決心…很了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620514,
					"content": "哪怕是出於善意被人保護起來，也不是她想要選擇的事吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620515,
					"content": "可是，哥倫比婭…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620516,
					"content": "就是因為她這麼努力，才更讓人擔心啊…就算她已經進入叛逆期，對我越來越不尊敬了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620517,
					"content": "等叛逆期過去，成熟期就會到來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620518,
					"content": "派蒙…如果妳能放開我…我會給妳比月亮還大的尊敬…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620519,
					"content": "但是這傢伙這麼大，萬一你被他吞噬了怎麼辦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620520,
					"content": "如果真是那樣…那一定也是使命的一部分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620521,
					"content": "你這傢伙！也太固執了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620522,
					"content": "也可以說這是她此刻心中最強烈的願望，對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620523,
					"content": "沒錯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620524,
					"content": "那麼，去吧寧寧，我相信你，讓這縷月光見證你的決定，並庇佑你的旅途。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620525,
					"content": "欸？這是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620526,
						760620527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620526,
					"content": "我也相信你，黑蛋。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620528
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620528,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們…那我開始了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620529,
					"content": "啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620530,
					"content": "黑蛋！你可要順利度過叛逆期啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620531,
					"content": "我可以的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620532,
					"content": "我…我成功了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620533,
					"content": "看來情況沒有想得那麼糟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620534,
					"content": "這樣真是太好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620535,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們…我得到了非常重要的資訊，我知道了烏吉恩圈和星空生物捕捉站發生了什麼事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620536,
					"content": "發生了什麼？我也很好奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620537,
					"content": "還是那個深空中的神秘訊號，它終於再次出現了，雖然那已經是龍族先驅離世的多年，但是沒關係…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620538
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620538,
					"content": "因為由他設計的望月者高塔——伊比尼伯龍之眼，精準地捕捉到了訊號發出的座標。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620539,
					"content": "終於做到了嗎？真是令人振奮！那是從哪裡發過來的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620540,
					"content": "從一片距離月球很遠的星空深處…那個地方即使飛船勉強能抵達，也會因為能源不足而無法返回。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620541,
					"content": "但是生命領域的研究者烏吉恩，他還是駕駛著一艘名為望月者號的飛船，前往了那個座標。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620542,
					"content": "他瘋了？他不打算回來了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620543
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620543,
					"content": "也許對他來說，能夠解讀訊號的真相就足夠了。而且那個距離，也許能夠將他的發現傳遞回來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620544
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620544,
					"content": "那之後發生了什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620545
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620545,
					"content": "他就此失蹤在星海之中，龍族也沒有接收到任何望月者號傳遞回來的訊息。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620546
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620546,
					"content": "…結果還是失敗了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620547
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620547,
					"content": "不，在那之後，又過去了數年時間，直到一天，星空生物捕捉站突然遭到不明物體的撞擊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620548
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620548,
					"content": "緊急修理後學者們發現，撞擊捕捉站的物體是一艘隱形飛船。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620549
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620549,
					"content": "隱形飛船？該不會是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620550
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620550,
					"content": "嗯…就是不知為何隱藏了身形的…望月者號。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620551
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620551,
					"content": "烏吉恩的妻子瑪歌率先進入了飛船，但她只在內部發現了一隻黑色的球形帶刺生物…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620552
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620552,
					"content": "古月力頻譜探測儀顯示，那個生物…符合烏吉恩的資訊特徵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620553
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620553,
					"content": "這、這是怎麼回事？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620554
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620554,
					"content": "瑪歌進行了一系列檢驗，發現她的愛人，正在與某種神秘生物融合。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620555
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620555,
					"content": "好可怕！那就是發出訊號的神秘星空生物嗎？烏吉恩被它吃了？他還有救嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620556
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620556,
					"content": "很遺憾，龍族學者們從來沒見過這種狀況，他們束手無策，只能眼睜睜地看著烏吉恩轉變為一種全新的生命…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620557
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620557,
					"content": "而後，烏吉恩醒來了，他向龍族傳遞了一個訊息。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620558
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620558,
					"content": "什麼消息？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620559
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620559,
					"content": "沒有關於這方面的內容。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620560
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620560,
					"content": "真是的，怎麼又缺少了內容？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620561
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620561,
					"content": "這樣看來，烏吉恩也太慘了…他還想捉人家，結果完全是被人家捉了啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620562
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620562,
					"content": "並不是這樣，飛船的日誌顯示，那個發出訊號的生物並沒有攻擊烏吉恩，反而是他主動與那個生物融合…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620563
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620563,
					"content": "如此一來，那個生物才能突破語言的障礙…將消息傳遞給龍族…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620564
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620564,
					"content": "真是令人驚訝的情況…這樣看，那則訊息或許就是望月者計畫的關鍵內容，我越來越好奇那是什麼了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620565
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620565,
					"content": "看來我們還得去其他地方找找看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620566
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620566,
					"content": "那之後…烏吉恩還活著嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620567
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620567,
					"content": "在傳遞訊息之後，烏吉恩就開始死去。但瑪歌是生命領域的專家，她使用了一種不成熟的技術。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620568
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620568,
					"content": "那種技術可以將生命體轉化為純粹的古月之力。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620569
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620569,
					"content": "哦！聽起來很像龍族的生命燃素化！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620570
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620570,
					"content": "那她成功了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620571
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620571,
					"content": "只成功了一半——她挽救了軀體…創造出了月球上第一隻非自然誕生的月靈，也就是月靈烏吉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620572
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620572,
					"content": "但是烏吉恩的意識，在這個過程中徹底消失了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620573
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620573,
					"content": "之後的日子，她將所有精力都投入對這種新生命的研究中，直到壽限到來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620574
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620574,
					"content": "然後她拜託學生盧沙里姆對她使用了同樣的技術，最終轉化為了新生命…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620575
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620575,
					"content": "和烏吉恩一樣，她的意識也沒有保留下來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620576
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620576,
					"content": "♪——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620577
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪歌"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620577,
					"content": "原來這就是你們的故事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620578
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620578,
					"content": "既然這樣，我想那隻星空生物向龍族傳遞的訊息，或許被這位盧沙里姆繼承了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620579
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620579,
					"content": "他是否也在某個地方建立了研究設施呢？望月者計畫的關鍵內容應該就儲存在那裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620580
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620580,
					"content": "他的研究設施恐怕已經不存在了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620581
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620581,
					"content": "#嗯？{F#妳}{M#你}們有過發現嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620582
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620582,
					"content": "告訴了哥倫比婭關於盧沙里姆、月幕工程和天外降臨者的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620583
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620583,
					"content": "居然是…被天外而來的降臨者毀滅了…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620584
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620584,
					"content": "我不得不想到…那位高天的主宰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620585
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620585,
					"content": "我也這麼認為。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620586
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620586,
					"content": "能夠遮蔽月亮的天幕…聽起來又和虛假之天很相似。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620587
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620587,
					"content": "是哦…感覺就像是虛假之天的幼年期！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620588
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620588,
					"content": "但是他的研究所已經被毀掉了，也許他自己都消失在那場爆炸裡了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620589
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620589,
					"content": "我有一個猜測，他或許沒有死在那場意外裡，他的研究也保留了下來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620590
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620590,
					"content": "欸？為什麼這麼說？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620591
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620591,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們看，除了月海以外，龍族的其他設施都沒有被摧毀——伊比尼伯龍之眼、烏吉恩圈、星空生物捕捉站。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620592
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620592,
					"content": "這看起來並不符合那位改造世界的規劃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620593
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620593,
					"content": "妳是說，是盧沙里姆保護了這些？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620594
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620594,
					"content": "嗯，籌碼或許就是他所掌握的研究成果，他帶著這些…追隨了那位高天的主宰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620595
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620595,
					"content": "我覺得妳說得很有道理！這樣看，他後來很可能還在繼續望月者計畫，會在哪裡呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620596
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620596,
					"content": "我知道月亮上還有一個地方，如果望月者計畫仍被保存在某處，也許就會是那裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620597
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620597,
					"content": "不過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620598
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620598,
					"content": "寧寧…你有什麼還沒告訴我們的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620599
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620599,
					"content": "…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620801
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620801,
					"content": "你的同類中，只有你在尋找使命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620802,
					"content": "對哦，感覺黑蛋的同鄉們都很無憂無慮！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620803,
					"content": "別擔心，我不是在強迫你回答。我只是…想更瞭解你一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620804,
					"content": "因為在我們見到的終端機中，似乎沒有一座記錄了你的資訊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620805,
					"content": "這…我也不知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620806,
					"content": "沒關係，我只是好奇，如果你不想說的話，也可以不說。我們相信你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620807,
					"content": "#如果我真的有事隱瞞了{F#妳}{M#你}們，會怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620808,
					"content": "這也只是…好奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620809,
					"content": "唔…隱瞞不一定是壞事。這是我從一位朋友那裡學到的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620810,
					"content": "但如果我生氣的話，或許會摘掉送你的小帽子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620811,
					"content": "那我也要把留給你的零食丟進月海！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620812,
					"content": "#我明白了，我可以承諾，對{F#妳}{M#你}們沒有半點隱瞞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620813,
					"content": "那我相信你的承諾了，寧寧。接下來就請跟我來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620814,
					"content": "在月亮的背面，那裡有一個基地，我的力量探查到那裡非常龐大。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620815,
					"content": "我本來打算留到最後再處理，因為打掃起來大概會很累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620816,
					"content": "但是現在，清理時間必須要提前了。我有預感，剩下的問題一定都能在那裡得到答案。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620817,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}們，我…需要怎麼回報這些？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "黑蛋"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620818,
					"content": "妳看，派蒙，寧寧是不是又變成熟了一些？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620819,
					"content": "真的哦…居然談起回報了！但我們是朋友，不用談這些啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620820,
					"content": "#嗯，這一點，還是{M#他}{F#她}教我的，寧寧你也可以學一學。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620821,
					"content": "是我的榮幸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620822
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760620822,
					"content": "所以，準備好了就跟我來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "哥倫比婭"
				},
				{
					"id": 760620527,
					"content": "我也相信你，寧寧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760620528
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}